<title>CROATIA: Croatian August trade deficit narrows to $219 mln. [CORRECTED 11:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>Croatian August trade deficit narrows to $219 mln. [CORRECTED 11:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA MERCHANDISE TRADE   AUGUST	JULY	 AUG '95</p>
<p> Balance (million USD)	 -219	  -318	  -233</p>
<p> Exports			    369	   414	   270</p>
<p> Imports			    588	   732	   503 NOTE</p>
<p>-- Exports rose 36.8 percent in August from August 1995 (corrects period of comparison) and imports 16.8 percent. January-August exports were 1.4 percent and imports 2.6 percent lower than in the same period of 1995.</p>
<p>-- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
